{"날짜": "2026-09-11", "시험지명": "초당고_고1_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260911-CL-G1S-58a1aa16", "문항": {"1": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">&lt;보기&gt;에서 집합인 것만을 있는 대로 고른 것은?</p><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">ㄱ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>과 가까운 수의 모임</div><div class=\"bl\">ㄴ. 대한민국 광역시의 모임</div><div class=\"bl\">ㄷ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math>보다 큰 자연수의 모임</div></div></p><p></p><div class=\"pcs c3\"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span>ㄱ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span>ㄴ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span>ㄱ, ㄷ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span>ㄴ, ㄷ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span>ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ</span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 1번 · 집합과 원소, 집합의 표현"}, "10": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">세 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>가 삼각형을 이루지 않도록 하는 모든 상수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 값의 합은?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 10번 · 세 직선의 위치 관계"}, "15": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>이 나타내는 도형이 그림과 같을 때, 방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>이 나타내는 도형은?</p><p></p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><div class=\"pcs c2 pic\"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 15번 · 방정식 f(x, y)=0이 나타내는 도형의 이동"}, "16": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">그림과 같이 반지름의 길이가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>인 구 모양의 조형물이 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에서 지면과 만난다. 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>로부터 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>만큼 떨어진 지점에 조명을 설치하여 비출 때, 이 조형물이 조명을 받는 부분의 최대 높이는? (단, 조명의 크기는 생각하지 않는다.)</p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>26</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>34</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 16번 · 원의 접선의 방정식: 원 밖의 점이 주어질 때"}, "17": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">그림과 같이 좌표평면 위에 세 점</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></p><p>이 있다. 선분 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>로 내분하는 점을 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>라 할 때, 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>가 삼각형 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 넓이를 이등분한다. 양수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 값은? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>는 원점이다.)</p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 17번 · 도형의 넓이를 이등분하는 직선"}, "18": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">좌표평면에서 두 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>에 모두 접하고 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>을 지나는 서로 다른 두 원의 중심을 각각 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>라 할 때, 선분 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>의 길이는?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>26</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 18번 · x축과 y축에 동시에 접하는 원의 방정식"}, "19": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>인 전체집합 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 세 부분집합 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>일 때, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>의 최댓값과 최솟값의 합은?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>73</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>82</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>89</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 19번 · 원소의 개수의 최댓값·최솟값"}, "20": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>을 지나고 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>에서의 거리가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>인 두 직선을 각각 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>이라 하자. 두 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 동시에 접하고 반지름의 길이가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>인 원 중에서 중심이 제<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>사분면 위에 있는 원의 중심의 좌표를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>라고 할 때, 상수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 순서쌍 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> 는? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>)</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 20번 · 점과 직선 사이의 거리"}}}